Third-party material
--------------------

Microsoft Excel 2013 XLL SDK

  The add-in is compiled against XLCALL.H, the type and constant definitions of
  Microsoft's Excel 2013 XLL SDK. It is not in this repository: its license
  (ExcelSDK_eula.rtf, inside the SDK's installer) forbids redistributing it, so the build
  downloads the installer from Microsoft and unpacks it in the build folder (sdk/README.md
  in the source repository). The built pyinex.xll and pyinex_core.dll contain no code
  from the SDK.

No other third-party code is included. Earlier versions were built on the xlw library;
none of its code remains.
